abstract: >-
  CarbonGate is a framework for integrating carbon-awareness into 
  GitOps workflows for Kubernetes deployments. It implements intelligent
  quality gates that consider real-time grid carbon intensity when making
  deployment decisions, enabling organizations to reduce deployment-associated
  carbon emissions by 23-31% while maintaining acceptable deployment velocity.
